      "durationMs": 2299,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:01:24Z",
      "textHash": "9692a50f4a465aca387e289a7d16bdd1a6c1becf2495154e2c79d9632c174db9"
    },
    {
      "key": "042160f",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_start",
      "sourceText": "Witamy w Paryżu! Paryż jest stolicą Francji. W Paryżu płynie bardzo słynna rzeka. Ta rzeka nazywa się Sekwana.",
      "sourceEnText": "Welcome to Paris! Paris is the capital of France. In Paris, there is a very famous river. This river is called the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_042160f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 8385,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:00:21Z",
      "textHash": "66e119f3c9a2265a89a2d6b26f613865409f4d1306de48b0b30e85331b07c3ed"
    },
    {
      "key": "0454688",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Aby zobaczyć miasto i znane miejsca",
