      "audioFile": "fr_10_0454688.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2429,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:02:07Z",
      "textHash": "a6e872dfefa12240f881317440bba2868f41909cccf0b47d4d56756a03dcd18c"
    },
    {
      "key": "047502b",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_boat_guide",
      "sourceText": "Statki turystyczne mają duże okna.",
      "sourceEnText": "Tourist boats have large windows.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_047502b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2299,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:03:32Z",
      "textHash": "7fce2e9ae80daed67a1e958dc68320f3b2cc3d1d10d9bf52aa50902a7ea1773a"
    },
    {
      "key": "0484ee9",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_people",
      "sourceText": "Most, po którym mogą chodzić wyłącznie ludzie, nazywa się...",
      "sourceEnText": "A bridge only for people to walk on is called a...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0484ee9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 3553,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:02:48Z",
      "textHash": "c96a421195f51e75efbab118268eba1bba2e1b14f0b6b53d5131a6b89c49b637"
